{
    "chapter_num": 13,
    "verses_count": 14,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Ark Brought from Kirjath Jearim"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David consulted with the captains of thousands and hundreds, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with every leader. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David said to all the assembly of Israel, “If "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it seems"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " good to you, and if it is of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " our God, let us send out to our brethren everywhere "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " left in all the land of Israel, and with them to the priests and Levites "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in their cities "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their common-lands, that they may gather together to us; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and let us bring the ark of our God back to us, for we have not inquired at it since the days of Saul.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then all the assembly said that they would do so, for the thing was right in the eyes of all the people."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David gathered all Israel together, from Shihor in Egypt to as far as the entrance of Hamath, to bring the ark of God from Kirjath Jearim. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David and all Israel went up to Baalah,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Baale Judah, 2 Sam. 6:2"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Kirjath Jearim, which belonged to Judah, to bring up from there the ark of God the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", who dwells "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "between"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the cherubim, where "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " name is proclaimed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. caused the ark of God to ride"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "carried the ark of God on a new cart from the house of Abinadab, and Uzza and Ahio drove the cart. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David and all Israel played "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "music"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " before God with all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " might, with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "songs"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "singing, on harps, on stringed instruments, on tambourines, on cymbals, and with trumpets."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they came to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Nachon, 2 Sam. 6:6"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Chidon’s threshing floor, Uzza put out his hand to hold the ark, for the oxen "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or let it go off"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "stumbled. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the anger of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was aroused against Uzza, and He struck him because he put his hand to the ark; and he died there before God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David became angry because of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "’s outbreak against Uzza; therefore that place is called "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Outburst Against Uzza"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Perez Uzza to this day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "David was afraid of God that day, saying, “How can I bring the ark of God to me?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David would not move the ark with him into the City of David, but took it aside into the house of Obed-Edom the Gittite. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The ark of God remained with the family of Obed-Edom in his house three months. And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " blessed the house of Obed-Edom and all that he had."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}